              "printed_page": 844,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "FDLE—collie, German shepherd dog, Siberian husky, Shetland sheepdog, Alaskan Malamute, chow chow, and their crosses.",
